{{for|the [[Star Chart]] planet|Jupiter}}
'''EFV-5 Jupiter''' is a {{Faction|Scaldra}} assault rifle used by [[Scaldra Jaeger]]s. Inflicts {{D|Corrosive}} damage with a highly accurate fully automatic primary fire while its [[Alternate Fire]] charges its underslung shotgun to fire.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Puncture}} damage.
*[[Alternate Fire]] charges for 1 second to release close-ranged buckshot.
**Innate [[multishot]] of 11 pellets.
**Consumes 15 ammo per shot.
**Projectiles have a guaranteed {{D|Corrosive}} proc.
*Innate two {{Pol|Madurai}} polarities.
*Can use the EFV-5 Jupiter-exclusive {{M|Overpressured Rounds}} mod.

{{Advantages|
}}

{{Disadvantages|
*Alternate Fire:
**Has linear [[damage falloff]] from 100% to 0.79% from 5m to 10m target distance (distances are affected by [[Projectile Speed]]).
***Cannot equip {{M|Terminal Velocity}}.
}}

==Acquisition==
EFV-5 Jupiter's blueprints can be purchased from [[Minerva]] of {{Faction|The Hex}} for {{sc|Standing}}; component blueprints for {{sc|5,000}} and the main blueprint for {{sc|15,000}} to a total of {{sc|30,000}}, all requiring '''Rank 5 - Pizza Party'''.

This weapon is also part of the [[Scaldra Dominance Pack]] for {{pc|655}}.

{{BuildAutomatic|type=Weapon}}

==Notes==

==Tips==
*{{Arcane|Primary Crux}} can be used to lower the [[Alternate Fire]]'s ammo consumption per shot from 15 down to 6.

==Trivia==
*The EFV-5 seems to be a modified version or variation of the {{Weapon|AX-52}}, sporting a similar upper receiver and barrel. While having a unique thumbhole stock, alternate magazine, added Efervon tubing, a larger custom handguard, and an under-barrel shotgun mounted to the handguard. Which is most likely modelled after a [[w:GP-25|GP-25 grenade launcher]].
*The planetary naming schemes of both the EFV-5 Jupiter and {{Weapon|EFV-8 Mars}} appear to be based on the ''[[wikipedia:IZh_(motorcycle)|IZh Jupiter-5]]'', a model of motorcycle popular in Eastern Europe from the 1980s to the 2000s, and is viewed as a symbol of the late post-Soviet 90s. Until its discontinuation in 2008, the IZh motorcycle brand in general was manufactured by the [[wikipedia:Kalashnikov Concern|Izhevsk Machine-Building Plant]], currently the largest firearm manufacturer in Russia.
*Jupiter is also the 5th planet in the Solar System and named after the Roman god of the sky and thunder.

